* gf180_sdm3_mb.spice - 4-bit (15-level) sdm3 variant for fs=512 kHz
* GENERATED by gen_sdm3_mb.py - do not edit by hand.
* All behavioral B-sources are RC-smoothed current-source form
* (target-v)/R into a hold cap, and all floor()/ternary logic is
* replaced by steep sigmoids: ngspice-46 fails to converge on
* discontinuous B-source branches (timestep-too-small at the input
* zero crossing, t=62.5026 ms). Sigmoid offsets put the transition
* between settled integer states, so settled values are exact.
* Requires: gf180_afe_cells.spice (OTA/TG/bias) + gf180_sdm3.spice
* (strongarm, nand2, inv). Loop timing/coefficients identical to sdm3.
* Flash thresholds and DWA/thermometer logic are BEHAVIORAL (ideal
* sources / B-sources) - silicon needs a ladder + DWA RTL.

* ---- 15-level flash: strongarm + SR latch per slice ----
