* ---- modulator top: sdm3 timing, 4-bit flash + behavioral DWA ----
* Nodes: TH0..TH14 = thermometer lines (H_i). External PUP clock (narrow
* pulse at PH1 rising edge) advances the DWA master register.
.subckt gf180_sdm3_mod_mb VINP VINN VCM_REF VP VN PH1 NPH1 PH2 NPH2 CMPCK PUP VDD33 VSS TH0 TH1 TH2 TH3 TH4 TH5 TH6 TH7 TH8 TH9 TH10 TH11 TH12 TH13 TH14 params: RSET=25k CC=10p
XINT1 VINN VINP VCM_REF VP VN O1P O1N PH1 NPH1 PH2 NPH2 VDD33 VSS SEL0 SEL1 SEL2 SEL3 SEL4 SEL5 SEL6 SEL7 SEL8 SEL9 SEL10 SEL11 SEL12 SEL13 SEL14 SELN0 SELN1 SELN2 SELN3 SELN4 SELN5 SELN6 SELN7 SELN8 SELN9 SELN10 SELN11 SELN12 SELN13 SELN14 gf180_sdm3_int1_mb RSET={RSET} CC={CC}
* int2 with swapped clock pins (samples PH2 / integrates PH1)
XINT2 O1N O1P VCM_REF VP VN O2P O2N PH2 NPH2 PH1 NPH1 VDD33 VSS SEL20 SEL21 SEL22 SEL23 SEL24 SEL25 SEL26 SEL27 SEL28 SEL29 SEL210 SEL211 SEL212 SEL213 SEL214 SEL2N0 SEL2N1 SEL2N2 SEL2N3 SEL2N4 SEL2N5 SEL2N6 SEL2N7 SEL2N8 SEL2N9 SEL2N10 SEL2N11 SEL2N12 SEL2N13 SEL2N14 gf180_sdm3_int2_mb RSET={RSET} CC={CC}
XFLASH O2P O2N CMPCK VDD33 VSS TH0 TH1 TH2 TH3 TH4 TH5 TH6 TH7 TH8 TH9 TH10 TH11 TH12 TH13 TH14 gf180_sdm3_flash15
* thermometer count as voltage (1 V per count), RC-filtered (tau ~4 ns)
RTHF0 TH0 THF0 2k
CTHF0 THF0 VSS 2p
RTHF1 TH1 THF1 2k
CTHF1 THF1 VSS 2p
RTHF2 TH2 THF2 2k
CTHF2 THF2 VSS 2p
RTHF3 TH3 THF3 2k
CTHF3 THF3 VSS 2p
RTHF4 TH4 THF4 2k
CTHF4 THF4 VSS 2p
RTHF5 TH5 THF5 2k
CTHF5 THF5 VSS 2p
RTHF6 TH6 THF6 2k
CTHF6 THF6 VSS 2p
RTHF7 TH7 THF7 2k
CTHF7 THF7 VSS 2p
RTHF8 TH8 THF8 2k
CTHF8 THF8 VSS 2p
RTHF9 TH9 THF9 2k
CTHF9 THF9 VSS 2p
RTHF10 TH10 THF10 2k
CTHF10 THF10 VSS 2p
RTHF11 TH11 THF11 2k
CTHF11 THF11 VSS 2p
RTHF12 TH12 THF12 2k
CTHF12 THF12 VSS 2p
RTHF13 TH13 THF13 2k
CTHF13 THF13 VSS 2p
RTHF14 TH14 THF14 2k
CTHF14 THF14 VSS 2p
BCSUM CSUM 0 V=(v(THF0)+v(THF1)+v(THF2)+v(THF3)+v(THF4)+v(THF5)+v(THF6)+v(THF7)+v(THF8)+v(THF9)+v(THF10)+v(THF11)+v(THF12)+v(THF13)+v(THF14))/v(VDD33)
* DWA pointer: master samples mod(p_slave - c + 15) during PUP,
* slave tracks master during PH2. p[n+1]=(p[n]-c[n]) mod 15.
* wrap via steep sigmoid of PNEXT (exact at settled integer states)
BNEXT PNEXT 0 V=v(PTRS)-v(CSUM)+15
BNEXTM PNEXTM 0 V=v(PNEXT)-15/(1+exp((14.5-v(PNEXT))/0.05))
* B-source current sample/hold with sigmoid clock gating
(idsw SW broke transient OP; discontinuous gating breaks tran conv)
BSHM PTRM VSS I=(v(PTRM)-v(PNEXTM))/1k/(1+exp((2.2-v(PUP))/0.05))
CPTRM PTRM VSS 10p
RPTRM PTRM VSS 1T
BSHS PTRS VSS I=(v(PTRS)-v(PTRM))/1k/(1+exp((2.2-v(PH2))/0.05))
CPTRS PTRS VSS 10p
RPTRS PTRS VSS 1T
*
* int1 unit selects (DWA): P-side unit j -> VP if rot(j-p) < 15-c.
* rot via sigmoid wrap of (j-p); sigmoid select; RC-smoothed (tau ~2 ns)
BSEL0 SEL0 VSS I=(v(SEL0)-v(VDD33)/(1+exp(((0-v(PTRS))+15/(1+exp((0-v(PTRS)+0.5)/0.05))+0.5-(15-v(CSUM)))/0.15)))/1k
BSELN0 SELN0 VSS I=(v(SELN0)-(v(VDD33)-v(SEL0)))/1k
BSEL1 SEL1 VSS I=(v(SEL1)-v(VDD33)/(1+exp(((1-v(PTRS))+15/(1+exp((1-v(PTRS)+0.5)/0.05))+0.5-(15-v(CSUM)))/0.15)))/1k
BSELN1 SELN1 VSS I=(v(SELN1)-(v(VDD33)-v(SEL1)))/1k
BSEL2 SEL2 VSS I=(v(SEL2)-v(VDD33)/(1+exp(((2-v(PTRS))+15/(1+exp((2-v(PTRS)+0.5)/0.05))+0.5-(15-v(CSUM)))/0.15)))/1k
BSELN2 SELN2 VSS I=(v(SELN2)-(v(VDD33)-v(SEL2)))/1k
BSEL3 SEL3 VSS I=(v(SEL3)-v(VDD33)/(1+exp(((3-v(PTRS))+15/(1+exp((3-v(PTRS)+0.5)/0.05))+0.5-(15-v(CSUM)))/0.15)))/1k
BSELN3 SELN3 VSS I=(v(SELN3)-(v(VDD33)-v(SEL3)))/1k
BSEL4 SEL4 VSS I=(v(SEL4)-v(VDD33)/(1+exp(((4-v(PTRS))+15/(1+exp((4-v(PTRS)+0.5)/0.05))+0.5-(15-v(CSUM)))/0.15)))/1k
BSELN4 SELN4 VSS I=(v(SELN4)-(v(VDD33)-v(SEL4)))/1k
BSEL5 SEL5 VSS I=(v(SEL5)-v(VDD33)/(1+exp(((5-v(PTRS))+15/(1+exp((5-v(PTRS)+0.5)/0.05))+0.5-(15-v(CSUM)))/0.15)))/1k
BSELN5 SELN5 VSS I=(v(SELN5)-(v(VDD33)-v(SEL5)))/1k
BSEL6 SEL6 VSS I=(v(SEL6)-v(VDD33)/(1+exp(((6-v(PTRS))+15/(1+exp((6-v(PTRS)+0.5)/0.05))+0.5-(15-v(CSUM)))/0.15)))/1k
BSELN6 SELN6 VSS I=(v(SELN6)-(v(VDD33)-v(SEL6)))/1k
BSEL7 SEL7 VSS I=(v(SEL7)-v(VDD33)/(1+exp(((7-v(PTRS))+15/(1+exp((7-v(PTRS)+0.5)/0.05))+0.5-(15-v(CSUM)))/0.15)))/1k
BSELN7 SELN7 VSS I=(v(SELN7)-(v(VDD33)-v(SEL7)))/1k
BSEL8 SEL8 VSS I=(v(SEL8)-v(VDD33)/(1+exp(((8-v(PTRS))+15/(1+exp((8-v(PTRS)+0.5)/0.05))+0.5-(15-v(CSUM)))/0.15)))/1k
BSELN8 SELN8 VSS I=(v(SELN8)-(v(VDD33)-v(SEL8)))/1k
BSEL9 SEL9 VSS I=(v(SEL9)-v(VDD33)/(1+exp(((9-v(PTRS))+15/(1+exp((9-v(PTRS)+0.5)/0.05))+0.5-(15-v(CSUM)))/0.15)))/1k
BSELN9 SELN9 VSS I=(v(SELN9)-(v(VDD33)-v(SEL9)))/1k
BSEL10 SEL10 VSS I=(v(SEL10)-v(VDD33)/(1+exp(((10-v(PTRS))+15/(1+exp((10-v(PTRS)+0.5)/0.05))+0.5-(15-v(CSUM)))/0.15)))/1k
BSELN10 SELN10 VSS I=(v(SELN10)-(v(VDD33)-v(SEL10)))/1k
BSEL11 SEL11 VSS I=(v(SEL11)-v(VDD33)/(1+exp(((11-v(PTRS))+15/(1+exp((11-v(PTRS)+0.5)/0.05))+0.5-(15-v(CSUM)))/0.15)))/1k
BSELN11 SELN11 VSS I=(v(SELN11)-(v(VDD33)-v(SEL11)))/1k
BSEL12 SEL12 VSS I=(v(SEL12)-v(VDD33)/(1+exp(((12-v(PTRS))+15/(1+exp((12-v(PTRS)+0.5)/0.05))+0.5-(15-v(CSUM)))/0.15)))/1k
BSELN12 SELN12 VSS I=(v(SELN12)-(v(VDD33)-v(SEL12)))/1k
BSEL13 SEL13 VSS I=(v(SEL13)-v(VDD33)/(1+exp(((13-v(PTRS))+15/(1+exp((13-v(PTRS)+0.5)/0.05))+0.5-(15-v(CSUM)))/0.15)))/1k
BSELN13 SELN13 VSS I=(v(SELN13)-(v(VDD33)-v(SEL13)))/1k
BSEL14 SEL14 VSS I=(v(SEL14)-v(VDD33)/(1+exp(((14-v(PTRS))+15/(1+exp((14-v(PTRS)+0.5)/0.05))+0.5-(15-v(CSUM)))/0.15)))/1k
BSELN14 SELN14 VSS I=(v(SELN14)-(v(VDD33)-v(SEL14)))/1k
* int2 code register: tracks CSUM during PH2, holds through PH1
* (smoothed B-source sample/hold; idsw SW broke transient OP)
BC2R C2R VSS I=(v(C2R)-v(CSUM))/1k/(1+exp((2.0-v(PH2))/0.05))
CC2R C2R VSS 0.5p
RC2R C2R VSS 1G
* int2 unit selects (straight thermometer from registered code)
BSEL20 SEL20 VSS I=(v(SEL20)-v(VDD33)/(1+exp((0+0.5-(15-v(C2R)))/0.15)))/1k
BSEL2N0 SEL2N0 VSS I=(v(SEL2N0)-(v(VDD33)-v(SEL20)))/1k
